<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Your deserter group has stumbled upon an old bunker, a potential haven. But with the valuable intel you carry, the Empire's visibility on you is alarmingly high. Aerodrones patrol the skies, and Imperial raiding parties are closing in. Use the intel to unlock powerful tech and deserter services, aiding your ultimate mission: to assassinate key Imperial nobility. Survive the initial onslaught and lay low; over time, the Empire's relentless search will wane. The choice is yours: fortify, adapt, or perish.-->
  <VFED_NewSafehaven.scenario.parts.13.text>你的逃兵小组偶然发现了一个旧掩体，一个潜在的避难所。但凭借你所掌握的宝贵情报，帝国对你的关注度高得惊人。无人机在天空中巡逻，帝国突袭部队正在逼近。利用情报解锁强大的科技和逃兵服务，帮助你完成最终任务：暗杀重要的帝国贵族。在最初的猛攻中幸存下来并保持低调；随着时间的推移，帝国不懈的搜寻将会减弱。选择权在你：强化、适应或灭亡。</VFED_NewSafehaven.scenario.parts.13.text>
  <!--EN: A deserter cell, laying low. A classic VFE - Deserters experience.-->
  <VFED_NewSafehaven.scenario.summary>一个逃兵牢房，处于低处。经典的 VFE - 逃兵体验。</VFED_NewSafehaven.scenario.summary>
</LanguageData>
